<p><strong>Question 14 (15 points): R Data Analysis with FEV1 Dataset</strong></p>
<p>Using the FEV1 dataset from class materials (available in week1_lecture_code.R):</p>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li>Write R code to load the data and calculate the mean FEV1 by gender. Include the output. (5 points)</li>
<li>Use the summary() function on the FEV1 variable and interpret what the 1st and 3rd quartiles tell us about the data. (5 points)</li>
<li>Create a frequency table for gender and calculate what percentage of subjects are female. Show your calculation. (5 points)</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>Code Submission Requirements:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Include ALL R code you used</li>
